### 1. Multiple Validation Failures (Expect 422 with 3 Field Errors)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Ayat",
  "phone": "9112233",
  "dish_ids": ["d1", "d1"]
}

# Expect: HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity
# Response:
# {
#   "error": {
#     "message": "the request was not valid",
#     "fields": {
#       "area": "must be a served delivery area",
#       "dish_ids": "must not contain duplicates",
#       "phone": "must be a valid TeleBirr number"
#     }
#   }
# }


### 2. Normalised Phone Success (+251911223344 -> 0911223344)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "+251911223344",
  "dish_ids": ["d1", "d2"]
}

# Expect: HTTP 201 Created -> "phone": "0911223344"


### 3. Unknown Dish ID (Expect 422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0911223344",
  "dish_ids": ["d999"]
}

# Expect: HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity
# Response: {"error":{"fields":{"dish_ids":"dish d999 does not exist"},"message":"the request was not valid"}}